FleetMiner Core: modular drone fleet script (miners, haulers, carriers) over IGC.

SETUP
  1. Load the script into a Programmable Block, then edit its Custom Data.
     Recompile once to write every key with its default value.
       [FleetMiner]
       Role=Miner          ; Miner | Hauler | Carrier
       Channel=FLEETMINER  ; must match across the whole fleet
       Callsign=MINER-1    ; HUD / screen name (empty = grid name)
  2. Drones need: a Remote Control facing the drill direction, gyros, thrusters
     on all six sides, a broadcasting antenna, and a connector tagged [FM Dock].
     Run 'selftest' to check the build.
  3. Optional tags (drone):
       [FM Cam] forward camera     [FM Eject] sorter + ejector (stone dump)
       [FM Sensor] threat sensor   [FM Light] status lights
  4. Carrier: [FM Dock] connectors (pads), [FM Pad N] pad lights,
     [FM Unload] cargo containers to fill.
  5. Screens (any LCD or cockpit/console screen):
       [FM LCD] status  [FM Gauges] drone gauges  [FM Map] / [FM Map N] site map
       [FM Board] flight control  [FM Log] comms log  [FM Stats] production
  6. Hooks: timers trigger / sound blocks play when named with
       [FM <State>] (Docked, Working, ...) or [FM Backout] [FM Rich]
       [FM Holding] [FM Launch] [FM Distress]
  Full guide: docs/MinerDrone.md in the source repo.

DRONE COMMANDS (PB argument)
  setsite [N]  Aim at the rock face and run. N (0-7) shares it via the carrier.
  site N       Join carrier library site N.
  start        Self-test, then the automatic mine -> dock -> unload -> launch cycle.
  return       Back out of the shaft, fly home and dock. The cycle stops.
  stop         Halt in place; dampeners on.
  skip         Abandon the current shaft.
  goto N       Mine shaft N next.
  resetsite    Forget shaft results; restart the spiral.
  forget       Forget the home carrier.

CARRIER COMMANDS
  launch | recall | halt   Fleet commands (launches are sequenced).
  assign N                 Send every drone to library site N.
  reset                    Clear pad reservations and queues.

ANY ROLE
  status       Detail page on the PB screen (self-test, learned models).
  selftest     Check the build.
  set K V      Change a Custom Data value live, e.g. 'set MineDepth 50'.
  resetstats   Zero production counters.
